	(text "Gear machine control board: Raspberry Pi Pico (drive control), 74HC gating (STROBE / JUDGE / CLEAR hardware path),\n3 x 74HC595 + 4 x TBD62783A outputs, 8 x TLP291 24 V inputs, 9 photointerrupter inputs, stepper drive interface (PUL / DIR / ENA).\nThe stop decision stays in the relay test register; this board only drives the motor and conditions signals."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
